{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"d804d94a-a7e6-4a67-88de-3a98a64c1783","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Fixed the state, cache-invalidation, defensive-copy, and monetary-rounding bugs across all four modules:\n\n- [store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_1795157655584_baseline/store.py):\n  - Stored `unit_rate`, `discount_rate`, `units`, and line `unit_rate` as `Decimal` instead of `float`.\n  - Incremented tenant `version` and invoked registered invalidation hooks on `upsert_tenant` (when updating an existing tenant), `update_tenant_tier` (`(tenant_id, None)`), and `record_usage` (`(tenant_id, period)`).\n  - Returned `copy.deepcopy` in `upsert_tenant`, `update_tenant_tier`, `record_usage`, `get_tenant`, and `get_snapshot`.\n- [cache.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_1795157655584_baseline/cache.py):\n  - Stored versioned entries and enforced `version` matching in `get`.\n  - Used `copy.deepcopy` on both `set` and `get` to prevent caller mutations from corrupting cached state.\n  - Updated `invalidate(tenant_id, period=None)` to remove all cached periods for `tenant_id` when `period is None` and return the removed count.\n- [billing.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_1795157655584_baseline/billing.py):\n  - Replaced binary float arithmetic with `Decimal` quantized to `Decimal(\"0.01\")` using `ROUND_HALF_UP`.\n  - Returned a `copy.deepcopy` of `cached_invoice` only when `(tenant_id, period, version)` matches `snapshot`, without re-applying discounts.\n- [api.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-007_1795157655584_baseline/api.py):\n  - Wired `self.store.register_invalidation_hook(self.cache.invalidate)` in `BillingAPI.__init__`.\n  - Updated `preview_invoice` to perform versioned cache lookups/stores and return defensive deep copies.\n\n### Verification\n- Ran `python -m pytest -v`: `tests\\test_visible.py::test_starter_invoice_smoke` passed (1 passed).\n","duration_seconds":54.9150334,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":48953,"output_tokens":8890,"thinking_tokens":2449,"cache_read_tokens":208693,"total_tokens":57843}}}
